#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Automatic. After the failed site is restored, 3 consecutive"
" healthy cycles (~3 minutes) must pass. Votes are restored, fenced nodes "
"reboot and rejoin. Redistribute VMs across sites after recovery."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Automático. Después de el falló site es restored, 3 "
"consecutive saludable cycles (~3 minutes) debe pass. Votes son restored, "
"fenced nodos reboot y rejoin. Redistribute VMs a través de sites después "
"de recuperación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:117
msgid "Two-Node Cluster Failures"
msgstr "Fallos de clúster de dos nodos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:119
msgid ""
"A two-Host GFS2 cluster uses a Distributed Worker witness as its third "
"quorum vote. One Host can remain operational after the other Host fails "
"only while the witness remains reachable. If the witness fails while both"
" Hosts are healthy, the cluster retains two of three votes but loses "
"Host-failure tolerance until the witness returns. See "
":doc:`two_node_clusters` for the complete failure and maintenance matrix."
msgstr "Un clúster GFS2 de dos Hosts utiliza un testigo Distributed Worker como su tercer voto de quorum. Un Host puede permanecer operativo después de que falle el otro Host solo mientras el testigo siga siendo accesible. Si el testigo falla mientras ambos Hosts están sanos, el clúster conserva dos de tres votos pero pierde tolerancia a fallos de Host hasta que el testigo regrese. Consulte :doc:`two_node_clusters` para la matriz completa de fallos y mantenimiento."

